#: ../../guide/agentic_tools_tutorial.rst:19 d90a305ac34649cc86d9c777e821c6fc
msgid "What are Agentic Tools?"
msgstr "什么是自主智能体工具？"

#: ../../guide/agentic_tools_tutorial.rst:21 607b539275ac4b9799784e348860aeea
msgid ""
"**Agentic Tools** are AI-powered tools that use Large Language Models (LLMs) "
"to perform tasks requiring human-like reasoning, analysis, and creativity. "
"Unlike traditional computational tools that follow fixed algorithms, agentic "
"tools use natural language prompts to Tutorial AI models."
msgstr ""
"**自主工具** 是利用大型语言模型（LLMs）驱动的人工智能工具，能够执行需要类人推"
"理、分析和创造力的任务。与遵循固定算法的传统计算工具不同，自主工具通过自然语"
"言提示来指导 AI 模型。"

#: ../../guide/agentic_tools_tutorial.rst:23 69ec5930f0d24af185b480ddc116958b
msgid ""
"**Perfect for**: Text analysis, research synthesis, creative writing, code "
"review, hypothesis generation"
msgstr "**适用于**：文本分析、研究综述、创意写作、代码审查、假设生成"

#: ../../guide/agentic_tools_tutorial.rst:25 1b78a807ce524da7aa3e7f55c7f26b8e
msgid ""
"**Not suitable for**: Mathematical calculations, API calls, file processing, "
"deterministic algorithms"
msgstr "**不适用于**：数学计算、API 调用、文件处理、确定性算法"

